# Configuration and credentials must be supplied at runtime, never copied into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/credentials.json
**/secrets
**/.aws
**/.ssh

# Source-control metadata, dependencies, caches, and generated output.
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/.vite
**/.tanstack
**/tmp
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
